{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03355",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.93,
      "end_seconds": 5.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Is this the the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.17,
      "end_seconds": 12.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.28,
      "text": "alright, not at all, please sit what seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.22,
      "end_seconds": 23.0,
      "duration_seconds": 9.78,
      "text": "honestly, it's shortness of breath, and my family pushed me to come. I just want to get back to normal, really"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.36,
      "end_seconds": 28.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.54,
      "end_seconds": 35.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.65,
      "text": "Uh, I take propranolol, 40 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.74,
      "end_seconds": 37.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "I see, go ahead"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.59,
      "end_seconds": 44.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Glibenclamide. I take it 5 milligrams, before breakfast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.48,
      "end_seconds": 47.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Yes. Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.37,
      "end_seconds": 57.35,
      "duration_seconds": 8.98,
      "text": "I'm not sure when it began, to be honest. Some weeks ago, but I can't say how many"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.88,
      "end_seconds": 64.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.31,
      "end_seconds": 85.66,
      "duration_seconds": 20.35,
      "text": "Uh, maybe a six out of ten on a bad day. Sitting forward helps a bit. Honestly, once or twice a day. I've also had chest pain, for three weeks. With chest pain, it settles a little with Sitting forward."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.17,
      "end_seconds": 90.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "okay, any fever, cough or leg swelling at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.63,
      "end_seconds": 94.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "No, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.88,
      "end_seconds": 98.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.59,
      "end_seconds": 101.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "No weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.02,
      "end_seconds": 108.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "now some background about your lifestyle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.4,
      "end_seconds": 127.14,
      "duration_seconds": 16.74,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring. I only drink at family occasions. I'm vegetarian and have been for years. I work in accounts at a hospital. No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.36,
      "end_seconds": 145.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.83,
      "end_seconds": 148.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.07,
      "end_seconds": 152.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.63,
      "end_seconds": 158.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "I had a varicose vein procedure last year"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.63,
      "end_seconds": 176.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.86,
      "end_seconds": 180.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "My father has Parkinson's disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.16,
      "end_seconds": 184.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.02,
      "end_seconds": 196.78,
      "duration_seconds": 10.76,
      "text": "I've got migraines. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.28,
      "end_seconds": 199.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "And besides that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.3,
      "end_seconds": 208.87,
      "duration_seconds": 8.57,
      "text": "I've had diabetes, yes. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.23,
      "end_seconds": 218.9,
      "duration_seconds": 8.67,
      "text": "Okay, I can see diabetes in your file as well. Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.82,
      "end_seconds": 230.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "sit still for a moment.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.08,
      "end_seconds": 246.14,
      "duration_seconds": 6.06,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 106 beats a minute, pressure 97 over 58, respiratory rate 20."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.65,
      "end_seconds": 249.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.71,
      "end_seconds": 253.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.18,
      "end_seconds": 259.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.47,
      "end_seconds": 261.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.38,
      "end_seconds": 276.83,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "your neck veins are swollen, the heart sounds are muffled and your blood pressure is low"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.38,
      "end_seconds": 282.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "that's the examination finished"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.42,
      "end_seconds": 305.63,
      "duration_seconds": 8.21,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. This is probably possible cardiac tamponade. I can't rule out a heart attack yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.17,
      "end_seconds": 309.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.92,
      "end_seconds": 336.4,
      "duration_seconds": 26.48,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the moment I'd say it's possible cardiac tamponade, and we'll know more once the an urgent echocardiogram is back i'm sending you for an urgent echocardiogram because of possible tamponade let's get an ECG, for chest pain you need an urgent heart scan and possibly a drain if the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.05,
      "end_seconds": 339.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "alright, I follow"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 341.22,
      "end_seconds": 349.3,
      "duration_seconds": 8.08,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again straight away. Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 350.04,
      "end_seconds": 354.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "So, I come back straight away. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 355.53,
      "end_seconds": 360.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 361.65,
      "end_seconds": 364.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 365.98,
      "end_seconds": 367.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}